.DS_Store

# File-manager / editor artifacts (an empty `.!45430!overlay_large.png` was
# committed into test/assets this way once).
.!*

# Test and benchmark scratch output. Fixtures (test/assets) and golden
# references (test/assets/references) are committed and must stay tracked.
test/tmp/
bench/tmp/

# Bundler. A library does not commit its lockfile: each supported Ruby has to
# resolve its own compatible set. Pinning one meant rubocop's `parallel`
# dependency, resolved on 3.3, made the 3.2 build unresolvable.
/.bundle/
Gemfile.lock
